*** UPGRADE INFO:  ( EXTREMELY IMPORTANT! )
    ~~~~~~~~~~~~
    o modified prompts.set line 365.
    o Must place the Smodem main file in your C: for use with Tempest and
      terminals etc.  If you want users to use smodem that is.
    o Set the new Hydra Chat Timeout setting in the defaults menu of the
      bbsconfig.  Setting is in minutes.
    o All prompts.set files for every language must be updated.
      You must add the new prompts 523-564 to the end of every prompts.set,
      except for the english one if you are just using mine.
    o Set the new BBSConfig Default window setting of Default Ansi Color.
      Recommended: White


*** PROGRAMMER INFO:
    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
    For programmers of other Servers, I added a new activity of Loaded
    Terminal for when the server loads the terminal program.  The
    activity number is 73.  Your server should check (before sending a
    command to the server), to make sure the activity of that node is not
    73.  If it is 73, give a message like:

    'Commands can not be sent to this node at this time'

    Also make note that your server should never send commands to the bbs
    if activity number 71 or 72 is active either (SModem Protocol).. and it
    should give the same message as above.


